flowchart TB
  subgraph Native[Native channel and channel-simple]
    NH[Host arrays and CPU workspaces] --> NC[OpenMP stages and CPU PoisFFT]
    NC --> NH
    NH --> NO[Original host output]
  end
  subgraph Selected[Selected GPU implementation: one shared domain]
    H[Native initialization and host arrays] -->|first required reads: H2D| D[Persistent device fields and reusable scratch]
    R[Canonical handles and epoch generation<br/>initialized / host-current / device-current regions<br/>queued users and completion dependencies] -. owns .-> H
    R -. owns .-> D
    D --> K[Generated kernels on runtime stream]
    K -->|declared writes| D
    D --> P[Checked external pressure task<br/>RHS read / Phi interior write<br/>persistent plan and workspace lease]
    P -->|same stream, preserve RHS and halos| D
    D -->|16-byte CFL record; wait| C[Native control and diagnostics]
    D -->|read-only wall-plane observations| C
    C -. read-only keeps device replica .-> D
    S[Proved MOVE_ALLOC swaps<br/>variable bindings change, storage survives] -. same physical handle .-> R
    D -->|D2D capture before conflicting writes| O[Two immutable device snapshot slots]
    O -->|capture event then DMA| B[Two pinned host snapshot slots]
    B -->|wait for DMA| W[Writer: original serialization<br/>slot freed only after writing]
    W -->|full queue applies backpressure| O
    D -->|publish host-visible values| F[Unsupported path or final teardown<br/>join writer, wait, release storage]
  end
